{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Aya  $Reimu  $Nitori  $Sanae  $Kanako  >The Hakurei Shrine."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The shrine that stood on the eastern border of Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The shrine trees stained crimson later than the mountain's."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "On the porch sat a lonely girl, pondering her album."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"It does make one think though...\""
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Could that god be telling the truth?\""
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Surely that can't be right though..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> But then again, I don't want to think about it now.\""
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"And I still didn't figure this stuff out.\""
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"These last few photos...I don't remember taking them."
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> And its of people I never even saw before, or since."
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Maybe I should ask Reimu at some point.\""
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Aya  >\"Why hello there! What are you doing here?"
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Oh, what a lovely album. You filled it to the brim!\""
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Ugh, why are you here?\""
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Aya  >\"Scoop-hunting.\""
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Hunt elsewhere, I'm not in the mood.\""
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Aya  >\"If I waited for the right mood, I'd wait forever."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> The perfect article doesn't just present itself."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> You have to hunt for it."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> And you are just very interesting, what can I say?\""
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"I don't want to be interesting...\""
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Aya  >\"I'm not leaving until I get some stuff to write.\""
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Fiiiine...",
                "<l$> What do you want to ask about?"
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> My grand photo adventures? Something else?\""
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Aya  >\"If it's not too much to ask,",
                "<l$> could you tell me about that new bracelet and hair?\""
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Hard pass...is what I'd like to say..."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> But you won't take that for an answer."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> In short, nothing is happening, it's just uh...fashion.\""
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Aya  >\"Fashion, is it?\""
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"Y-yeah...just, trying to fit in with the shrine more.\""
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Aya  >\"And you even changed some strands of hair for that?\""
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Jessica  >\"This interview is over. Shouldn't you be elsewhere anyways?"
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> The Genbu Ravine is in chaos, why don't you report about that?\""
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just like that, the tengu flew off in a frenzy."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Jessica knew that something was happening at the ravine.",
                "But how did she know that?"
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Some call it intuition, some call it instinct.",
                "If you were to ask her yourself she'd probably say:"
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't worry about it.",
                "Now let me sort my thoughts a bit more."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "　　"
            ]
        },
        "38_1": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.01 — Tengu are as pushy as ever$>"
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> <c$Congratulations, all clear! Just as I'd expected!$>"
            ]
        }
    }
}